WEBVTT

00:00:11.110 --> 00:00:15.640
My right hand holds a bowl of gold,

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:20.180
And my left holds one of silver.

00:00:20.180 --> 00:00:24.720
Never one without the other,

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:37.800
Two unseen bowls for each of us.

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:46.210
The golden one is filled with joy,

00:00:46.210 --> 00:00:53.550
shining warmly.

00:00:53.550 --> 00:00:58.350
Since we met, my golden bowl

00:00:58.350 --> 00:01:05.360
cannot hold all my happiness and love.

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:15.500
Golden joy, silver sadness,

00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:22.850
I would leave my past behind...

00:01:22.850 --> 00:01:27.580
For you, for the sake of love,

00:01:27.580 --> 00:01:34.520
I would empty the bowls of my past.

00:01:53.570 --> 00:01:56.110
Yes, that's right. It was the four of us.

00:01:56.310 --> 00:01:58.520
We four planned it together.

00:01:59.600 --> 00:02:03.020
We thought we could force you to resign,

00:02:03.020 --> 00:02:05.700
...if we exposed the secret between you and Misonoo Nanako.

00:02:06.460 --> 00:02:09.140
That was our plan.

00:02:09.730 --> 00:02:12.680
But, as it turned out, we couldn't find anything.

00:02:13.350 --> 00:02:16.760
There was no secret to begin with.

00:02:19.200 --> 00:02:21.210
Here are our resignations...

00:02:22.270 --> 00:02:24.950
You resign? Of your own free will?

00:02:25.150 --> 00:02:26.350
That is correct.

00:02:30.920 --> 00:02:31.790
Very well then.

00:02:37.330 --> 00:02:38.810
Thank you for your trouble.

00:02:40.280 --> 00:02:41.820
Take care.

00:02:58.920 --> 00:03:00.190
Miya-sama!

00:03:00.550 --> 00:03:03.560
Please, there's one thing I hope you understand.

00:03:05.770 --> 00:03:09.590
This was something we did solely to protect the Sorority.

00:03:09.590 --> 00:03:10.660
I swear!

00:03:13.080 --> 00:03:19.240
The Sorority can't be maintained solely on the strength of your pride.

00:03:21.030 --> 00:03:25.920
Right now, we need something other than idealism and pride.

00:03:26.050 --> 00:03:30.010
For instance, we might try inviting some regular students to some of our parties,

00:03:30.010 --> 00:03:34.160
...or opening up the Sorority opera concert to the student body, even!

00:03:34.430 --> 00:03:38.650
We need some new ideas to insure that the Sorority continues to exist...

00:03:38.650 --> 00:03:41.330
To insure that the Sorority continues to exist?

00:03:41.900 --> 00:03:46.520
Yes! What if the Sorority perishes because of your stubborn pride...

00:03:46.520 --> 00:03:48.130
...where's the good in that?

00:03:48.340 --> 00:03:52.020
We need to work to protect the special Sorority privileges we have!

00:03:56.980 --> 00:03:58.590
Oh! Listen to you, now...

00:03:59.290 --> 00:04:04.180
Is that really all the Sorority means to you?

00:04:10.870 --> 00:04:16.500
<b>32. Pride, and the Final Meeting</b>

00:04:18.160 --> 00:04:20.370
Please lend us your support!

00:04:20.640 --> 00:04:24.720
One simple vote, and the Sorority is abolished.

00:04:24.720 --> 00:04:26.060
Please support us!

00:04:28.220 --> 00:04:29.820
Thank you.

00:04:29.960 --> 00:04:32.840
Thank you. Thank you!

00:04:34.310 --> 00:04:36.250
Dear Brother,

00:04:36.260 --> 00:04:38.060
...my newly found Brother...

00:04:38.660 --> 00:04:41.740
Our petition is progressing very well.

00:04:42.660 --> 00:04:48.020
Yesterday, we reached the one-third mark.

00:04:48.490 --> 00:04:53.380
At this rate, reaching the one-half mark this week might be no fantasy after all.

00:04:54.050 --> 00:04:57.400
It's going well -- perhaps even too well.

00:04:57.800 --> 00:05:02.890
My Brother, at times like this I find myself pondering things.

00:05:03.340 --> 00:05:05.680
Is this really the right thing to do?

00:05:06.090 --> 00:05:08.970
Should I be involved in this?

00:05:09.590 --> 00:05:12.470
The better things go, the more I wonder...

00:05:13.160 --> 00:05:15.100
Do you ever feel that way?

00:05:15.760 --> 00:05:17.230
I suppose you must.

00:05:20.360 --> 00:05:22.300
Here is what happened today.

00:05:23.740 --> 00:05:25.480
Misonoo-san?

00:05:25.630 --> 00:05:30.320
Nanako-san... is there a place where we can sign too?

00:05:30.640 --> 00:05:33.520
Katorea-no-Kimi! Vampanera-no-Kimi!

00:05:34.090 --> 00:05:35.700
Yes, of course!

00:05:36.130 --> 00:05:39.210
Amazing! You're all important Sorority members!

00:05:39.820 --> 00:05:41.490
Not any more.

00:05:42.040 --> 00:05:43.440
Did you... leave?

00:05:43.580 --> 00:05:46.120
Yes, we did. Just now.

00:05:46.560 --> 00:05:47.830
Oh. OK...

00:05:48.010 --> 00:05:49.150
So, that's that.

00:05:50.630 --> 00:05:52.170
Thank you.

00:05:52.410 --> 00:05:53.220
You're welcome. <b> </b>

00:05:53.220 --> 00:05:54.960
You're welcome. The best of luck to you.

00:06:00.150 --> 00:06:01.560
My Brother,

00:06:01.560 --> 00:06:03.840
...today I noticed something new.

00:06:04.340 --> 00:06:09.300
Bit by bit, the Sorority has begun to unravel from within.

00:06:10.810 --> 00:06:14.030
Please, wait! Yamamoto-san! Hoshino-san!

00:06:19.490 --> 00:06:22.640
What do you think you're doing? How can you sign the petition??

00:06:24.060 --> 00:06:26.540
What on earth are you thinking?

00:06:27.300 --> 00:06:31.720
This movement is why we were expelled from the Sorority!

00:06:33.060 --> 00:06:35.600
How can you support the campaign?!

00:06:42.040 --> 00:06:45.930
You have no right to say that.

00:06:46.260 --> 00:06:51.020
We had to leave the Sorority because of our involvement with you!

00:06:51.970 --> 00:06:55.320
But now... but now, it doesn't matter.

00:06:55.750 --> 00:06:58.100
Only the future matters.

00:06:58.510 --> 00:07:00.720
After being expelled from it,

00:07:00.720 --> 00:07:03.540
...we'll not rest easy until that Sorority is abolished. Never!

00:07:03.740 --> 00:07:08.960
Yes! How can I watch Miya-sama's followers living the high life as usual...

00:07:08.960 --> 00:07:11.640
I can't watch all that from the sidelines!

00:07:14.730 --> 00:07:20.430
Better to end the Sorority forever than to suffer through that. Don't you agree?

00:07:20.610 --> 00:07:23.760
We could never... feel that way...

00:07:44.370 --> 00:07:46.780
So, what happened?

00:07:46.910 --> 00:07:49.320
Umm... well, it's like this...

00:07:49.530 --> 00:07:51.740
It's best to just say it.

00:07:51.870 --> 00:07:56.290
Katorea-no-Kimi and Vampanera-no-Kimi signed, as you know.

00:07:56.290 --> 00:08:01.320
Then today they were joined by Mona-Lisa-no-Kimi and Borgia-no-Kimi.

00:08:01.750 --> 00:08:05.440
All four of them have resigned as members.

00:08:05.840 --> 00:08:08.560
They may do as they wish.

00:08:08.850 --> 00:08:11.020
Yes... yes, but...

00:08:11.810 --> 00:08:16.800
But they say the petition has been signed by nearly half the students.

00:08:16.920 --> 00:08:18.470
Excuse me...

00:08:18.550 --> 00:08:20.160
Hand me that vase, please...

00:08:20.230 --> 00:08:21.970
What? Oh... OK.

00:08:23.940 --> 00:08:26.090
Thank you, Medusa-san.

00:08:28.530 --> 00:08:31.380
Finally, more than half!

00:08:32.670 --> 00:08:35.870
When Mona-Lisa-no-Kimi and Borgia-no-Kimi signed,

00:08:35.870 --> 00:08:38.080
...it seemed to turn the tide in our favor.

00:08:38.350 --> 00:08:42.840
When it reaches two-thirds, shall we present it to the school board?

00:08:42.970 --> 00:08:44.180
I can hardly believe it. <b> </b>

00:08:44.180 --> 00:08:44.910
I can hardly believe it. What?

00:08:44.910 --> 00:08:49.270
That the Sorority is so intensely hated by so many students,

00:08:49.270 --> 00:08:51.680
...it's hard to believe. I don't WANT to believe it.

00:08:51.680 --> 00:08:53.420
Yes, it's real!

00:08:53.420 --> 00:08:55.630
This is how it really is!

00:08:55.830 --> 00:08:57.040
Listen to this then...

00:08:57.040 --> 00:09:00.060
Today a classmate shoved a petition book in my face.

00:09:01.240 --> 00:09:04.590
Then, here's what she says: "Sign it."

00:09:04.590 --> 00:09:07.940
"If you do, I'll forgive you for everything you did in the past."

00:09:08.940 --> 00:09:14.230
As if I had sinned merely by joining the Sorority...

00:09:14.230 --> 00:09:15.370
What?!

00:09:15.630 --> 00:09:20.560
Maybe it would be wiser... not to stick with the Sorority,

00:09:20.800 --> 00:09:24.860
...because of the social backlash following the abolition of the Sorority...

00:09:24.980 --> 00:09:27.640
No, no! You mustn't allow yourself to get demoralized.

00:09:27.760 --> 00:09:30.250
Don't you realize that now, of all times,

00:09:30.370 --> 00:09:33.660
...is the time you must support Miya-sama!

00:09:33.780 --> 00:09:34.720
Yeah...

00:09:42.460 --> 00:09:44.570
It's heartbreaking to see you.

00:09:44.850 --> 00:09:47.180
You, who were once our friend.

00:09:47.300 --> 00:09:51.540
Ah, here's someone who signed up to abolish the Sorority.

00:09:51.660 --> 00:09:54.330
I don't recall any friend who would do such a thing.

00:09:54.640 --> 00:09:55.740
Excuse me.

00:09:55.860 --> 00:09:57.430
I don't think you understand.

00:09:57.550 --> 00:09:59.940
Why stay with the sinking ship until the very end,

00:10:00.060 --> 00:10:02.680
...when only the captain gets any glory from it?

00:10:07.520 --> 00:10:10.760
The best course... is to abandon ship.

00:11:16.200 --> 00:11:16.880
Rei!

00:12:02.920 --> 00:12:03.920
Who's there?

00:12:06.760 --> 00:12:09.640
I'll be right out! Please wait!

00:12:14.650 --> 00:12:19.130
I... I have something I must ask you.

00:12:19.430 --> 00:12:22.480
You can answer just with a "yes" or "no".

00:12:22.600 --> 00:12:23.460
All right?

00:12:25.000 --> 00:12:28.560
You've become part of the petition drive...

00:12:28.680 --> 00:12:31.610
Did you do that just because you hate me?

00:12:34.920 --> 00:12:37.620
Just say "yes" or "no".

00:12:39.120 --> 00:12:39.630
Yes.

00:12:41.130 --> 00:12:41.980
Thank you.

00:12:43.880 --> 00:12:45.110
No!

00:12:47.790 --> 00:12:49.020
...yes!

00:12:50.100 --> 00:12:51.260
No!

00:12:51.880 --> 00:12:52.640
Rei...

00:12:53.080 --> 00:12:56.470
Yes! I do hate you!

00:12:58.220 --> 00:12:58.820
Rei.

00:12:59.180 --> 00:13:01.960
No... but I love you!

00:13:02.650 --> 00:13:03.600
Rei...

00:13:04.400 --> 00:13:06.870
Hate...? ...but I love you!

00:13:06.990 --> 00:13:09.950
Yes, I love you! I love you!

00:13:10.360 --> 00:13:13.530
But... I hate you! Hate you! HATE YOU!

00:13:23.760 --> 00:13:25.150
Why can't I remember?

00:13:25.790 --> 00:13:28.210
What was its name...

00:13:29.670 --> 00:13:37.150
That tiny village had a beach... its name escapes me now...

00:13:41.670 --> 00:13:44.630
There was the roar of the surf in my ears...

00:13:44.980 --> 00:13:50.050
...and snow falling, as if it didn't know how to stop.

00:13:50.170 --> 00:13:52.170
I remember that part well enough.

00:13:53.430 --> 00:13:55.880
But somehow, the name still eludes my memory.

00:13:56.560 --> 00:14:00.720
Then, I realized I had forgotten that one thing...

00:14:02.270 --> 00:14:04.460
...despite its importance.

00:14:04.580 --> 00:14:07.380
Despite how utterly vital it is for the two of us!

00:14:10.350 --> 00:14:12.920
Please tell me... tell me that name!

00:14:13.040 --> 00:14:14.560
You remember it, don't you?

00:14:14.930 --> 00:14:17.060
Surely you couldn't have forgotten it!

00:14:17.680 --> 00:14:21.440
If you've forgotten... Then, I'll forget, too.

00:14:21.720 --> 00:14:23.050
Tell me!

00:14:53.110 --> 00:14:56.010
Tea ceremony... Did you say, tea ceremony?!!

00:14:56.130 --> 00:14:59.910
Yes. A tea ceremony, after school, at the Sorority House.

00:15:00.030 --> 00:15:03.110
All Sorority members are invited.

00:15:03.230 --> 00:15:04.740
All the members?

00:15:05.110 --> 00:15:06.290
Katsuragi-san,

00:15:06.520 --> 00:15:09.900
...you are the only senior member remaining.

00:15:10.460 --> 00:15:14.770
I'm relying on you to choose those who make the preparations,

00:15:15.070 --> 00:15:17.030
...and to summon all of the members.

00:15:19.270 --> 00:15:23.090
By the way... I gave official notice to the school board today.

00:15:23.210 --> 00:15:27.310
You are replacing Komabayashi-san as vice-president of the Sorority.

00:15:29.990 --> 00:15:31.740
Please do your best.

00:15:32.250 --> 00:15:33.560
These are difficult times.

00:15:33.970 --> 00:15:35.310
I will.

00:15:35.980 --> 00:15:36.810
A tea ceremony? <b> </b>

00:15:36.810 --> 00:15:37.400
A tea ceremony? Yes.

00:15:37.680 --> 00:15:41.550
The remaining members are making a last stand.

00:15:42.020 --> 00:15:45.330
This has become quite a crisis, hasn't it.

00:15:45.560 --> 00:15:47.630
Believe it or not,

00:15:47.750 --> 00:15:51.990
...a third of the Sorority have either resigned or signed the petition.

00:15:52.250 --> 00:15:54.910
By the time I come back to school,

00:15:55.030 --> 00:15:57.100
...things might be completely different there.

00:15:57.220 --> 00:15:58.530
Hmm. Could be.

00:15:59.280 --> 00:16:05.020
It seems to me that it isn't just the school...

00:16:05.270 --> 00:16:07.240
...perhaps people's minds have changed as well.

00:16:07.710 --> 00:16:10.700
I'd prefer to believe that it is only on the surface.

00:16:10.820 --> 00:16:11.540
What?!!

00:16:12.660 --> 00:16:15.240
I have something to show you.

00:16:20.570 --> 00:16:23.160
It's my father's old novel.

00:16:24.890 --> 00:16:30.200
Ichinomiya-san... um... Takashi-san had a copy and gave it to me.

00:16:30.450 --> 00:16:33.560
Now, it seems like so long ago...

00:16:34.800 --> 00:16:38.470
Papa had just met my mother. He fell in love with her,

00:16:38.590 --> 00:16:40.620
...and they'd begun to live together.

00:16:40.740 --> 00:16:45.520
That was before I was born, and before he was a famous writer.

00:16:45.820 --> 00:16:49.600
They were so poor they couldn't even pay the rent.

00:16:50.130 --> 00:16:54.300
It was Papa's wild youth... he had only his dream then.

00:16:55.330 --> 00:16:58.380
When he had only love and talent to comfort him...

00:16:58.970 --> 00:17:01.270
...this is the novel that reflected those times.

00:17:01.750 --> 00:17:05.100
It is a very, very beautiful novel.

00:17:07.180 --> 00:17:08.640
It made me happy...

00:17:08.760 --> 00:17:11.190
...and though it's true that he is known as a porn writer now,

00:17:11.310 --> 00:17:18.430
...my finding that he'd written this made me so happy deep inside.

00:17:21.470 --> 00:17:25.260
It filled me with pride to know that I am his daughter.

00:17:25.380 --> 00:17:27.260
That's how I felt.

00:17:28.180 --> 00:17:30.310
I came to think...

00:17:30.430 --> 00:17:34.650
...that this was who he really was -- that I'd found his true self.

00:17:35.710 --> 00:17:39.620
Could I read it? I'd like to borrow it.

00:17:39.740 --> 00:17:42.670
Me too, me too! After Nanako.

00:17:43.570 --> 00:17:44.550
Thank you.

00:17:48.870 --> 00:17:51.560
She hopes the changes are only surface ones,

00:17:51.680 --> 00:17:55.760
...so that our souls can remain forever unchanged.

00:17:56.840 --> 00:17:58.320
My Dear Brother...

00:17:58.640 --> 00:18:01.620
I think that is what Mariko-san wanted to say.

00:18:01.950 --> 00:18:03.890
At least, I think so.

00:18:04.430 --> 00:18:06.360
But... but still...

00:18:10.030 --> 00:18:11.130
But...

00:18:18.410 --> 00:18:21.220
Miya-sama, the tea ceremony is ready.

00:18:21.340 --> 00:18:22.780
Thank you for all you've done.

00:18:23.050 --> 00:18:24.460
You... you're welcome.

00:18:25.110 --> 00:18:26.460
What a shame.

00:18:27.370 --> 00:18:29.650
It's just under two-thirds.

00:18:29.770 --> 00:18:31.850
Really? After all that work?

00:18:31.880 --> 00:18:34.860
It's OK. There's tomorrow, and the day after.

00:18:38.030 --> 00:18:41.560
Hey, you'd better stop doing that in the classroom.

00:18:41.680 --> 00:18:43.580
I think you're probably right.

00:18:43.840 --> 00:18:46.730
Did you hear? About the tea ceremony?

00:18:46.850 --> 00:18:50.630
Yes, none of the members are going...

00:18:50.880 --> 00:18:54.410
The ex-members managed to organize a boycott.

00:18:54.530 --> 00:18:56.980
That's the end of Miya-sama, then, isn't it?

00:19:04.090 --> 00:19:09.730
Is that so? You, alone, prepared all the flowers and tea?

00:19:10.210 --> 00:19:13.240
Yes... no one else... was willing to help.

00:19:17.880 --> 00:19:19.990
Could you try one more time?

00:19:20.430 --> 00:19:22.890
Ask all the members to come.

00:19:23.470 --> 00:19:25.820
I'll be waiting.

00:19:26.380 --> 00:19:28.950
Yes, I'll do that. Right away.

00:19:37.730 --> 00:19:39.830
Please, listen to me!

00:19:39.840 --> 00:19:42.100
Miya-sama is waiting for you!

00:19:42.120 --> 00:19:45.230
She's alone! Alone and waiting at the Sorority house!

00:19:45.350 --> 00:19:48.760
No! The Sorority is going to be abolished.

00:19:48.980 --> 00:19:52.650
I've had enough of being looked down on by my classmates!

00:19:52.860 --> 00:19:54.570
But... Miya-sama is there...!

00:19:54.690 --> 00:19:57.500
Shouldn't you take advantage of this opportunity too?

00:19:59.990 --> 00:20:02.630
If you refuse to return to the Sorority house,

00:20:03.120 --> 00:20:04.760
...then you can join the rest of us here.

00:20:04.770 --> 00:20:06.030
I can't.

00:20:06.610 --> 00:20:07.790
Why not?

00:20:11.750 --> 00:20:15.860
Say, Orihara-san... do you think you could convince her?

00:20:15.980 --> 00:20:18.560
Tell her that the era of Miya-sama is finished.

00:20:18.950 --> 00:20:22.150
That's right. The era of Kaoru-no-Kimi is starting.

00:20:22.180 --> 00:20:26.710
The strongest candidate to replace Miya-sama is Kaoru-no-Kimi.

00:20:26.960 --> 00:20:29.670
See, Katsuragi-san? It's OK.

00:20:29.680 --> 00:20:34.030
Just declare your resignation here in front of Orihara-san, and you'll be safe.

00:20:39.190 --> 00:20:40.460
Now listen here, all of you!

00:20:46.040 --> 00:20:50.890
The reason I started this campaign was to put an end to that sort of thinking!

00:20:51.120 --> 00:20:54.450
This leads to the same rotten situation as before!

00:20:59.830 --> 00:21:00.360
Rei!

00:21:01.030 --> 00:21:03.650
Saint-Juste-sama... Saint-Juste-sama...!

00:21:29.370 --> 00:21:30.620
Fukiko-sama.

00:21:31.040 --> 00:21:35.710
It's been so long... I've kept you waiting so long.

00:21:35.950 --> 00:21:38.710
Finally, everyone is here.

00:21:39.660 --> 00:21:43.310
Let's begin. Let's start, now.

00:21:48.840 --> 00:21:52.850
Thank you. Thank you, all of you.

00:21:53.150 --> 00:21:54.990
Welcome to the Sorority.

00:21:55.110 --> 00:21:57.980
Welcome to a Sorority House tradition.

00:21:58.280 --> 00:22:01.140
I love this Sorority House.

00:22:02.550 --> 00:22:04.700
I love all things beautiful.

00:22:05.390 --> 00:22:07.880
I love those things which bring dignity to us all.

00:22:08.000 --> 00:22:10.900
Or rather... I seek to perfect my love.

00:22:11.560 --> 00:22:17.460
I seek to devote my love to that which brings dignity, beauty, and lasting value.

00:22:18.570 --> 00:22:21.310
I seek to become one who loves these things well.

00:22:21.990 --> 00:22:25.690
I seek to elevate myself to that high standard.

00:22:26.240 --> 00:22:30.730
Pride is something you cannot have unless you long for it.

00:22:30.850 --> 00:22:35.440
I am always asking myself if I truly have such pride.

00:22:36.090 --> 00:22:37.220
Sometimes I do not know the answer.

00:22:38.340 --> 00:22:43.480
From time to time, I may feel as if I want to give up.

00:22:44.120 --> 00:22:48.340
But I know it cannot be attained without sufficient longing.

00:22:48.770 --> 00:22:53.310
So I seek constantly to grow and maintain my dignity and pride...

00:22:53.980 --> 00:22:55.990
...no matter what may happen.

00:23:00.820 --> 00:23:02.740
To all of you Sorority members,

00:23:02.860 --> 00:23:07.150
...let me say that as long as I feel thus, I will continue as president of the Sorority.

00:23:07.800 --> 00:23:12.540
Even if I am the only one... this is where I will remain.

00:23:16.560 --> 00:23:19.560
Now, please enjoy your tea.

00:23:26.320 --> 00:23:27.530
My Brother...

00:23:28.220 --> 00:23:33.020
Mariko-san's father wrote something similar in his novel.

00:23:33.640 --> 00:23:35.500
"If one never accepts anything less

00:23:35.620 --> 00:23:37.960
...than those things which are worthy of the greatest sacrifice,

00:23:38.080 --> 00:23:41.300
...then no matter what happens,

00:23:41.420 --> 00:23:44.520
even if every drop of blood leaves your body,

00:23:44.640 --> 00:23:47.050
...you will suffer no regrets."

00:24:10.160 --> 00:24:14.360
I dreamed I was chasing a rainbow...

00:24:14.360 --> 00:24:19.830
Then the rainbow I was chasing was you.

00:24:21.300 --> 00:24:25.440
Before, I had no strength, no will.

00:24:25.440 --> 00:24:30.910
But now because of you, I do.

00:24:31.650 --> 00:24:37.190
Feelings of love, like raindrops

00:24:37.190 --> 00:24:42.660
Come pouring from the sky.

00:24:42.660 --> 00:24:45.390
This is surely a game

00:24:45.390 --> 00:24:48.200
Of some mischievous fairy...

00:24:48.200 --> 00:24:50.600
Always dancing,

00:24:50.600 --> 00:24:55.870
Always capricious...
